<body>
Reports problems in the front matter and the prompt of Markdown files in <code>.air/workflows</code>.
<p>The inspection reports these problems:</p>
<ul>
  <li>No YAML front matter: the file does not start with a <code>---</code> line, or the front matter has no closing <code>---</code> line.</li>
  <li>An incorrect or unknown field, or an incorrect cron expression.</li>
  <li>An empty prompt after the front matter.</li>
</ul>
<p>Example:</p>
<pre><code>---
name: Nightly review
trigger:
  kind: schedule
  cron: "0 8 * * MONDAY"
agent:
  name: codex
---
</code></pre>
<p>Here <code>MONDAY</code> is not a weekday name, and the prompt is empty.</p>
<p>Use <b>Fix with agent</b> to open an agent draft that fixes the errors in the workflow file.</p>
</body>
